option=allowed:the UPDATE carries no NEXT_HOP attribute beside MP_REACH_NLRI, where the recording repeats the next hop as one: RFC 4760 Section 3 says "An UPDATE message that carries no NLRI, other than the one encoded in the MP_REACH_NLRI attribute, SHOULD NOT carry the NEXT_HOP attribute.", and ExaBGP 6.0 sends the same bytes ze does (owner decision, 2026-10-20)
